<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.0000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.0000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.0000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 74.3400 on Thursday.</p>
